help.sources_rename = Gives this input a name of your own. Erase it all to go back to the TV's name.
help.sources_move = Picks this row up to move it: the picker shows the inputs in this order.
help.sources_grabbed = ▲ ▼ move the row, OK drops it there, Back puts it back where it was.
help.avr_pick_auto = Takes the receiver this TV sees on its HDMI. Nothing else to set.
help.avr_pick_found = Uses this receiver, whichever of the TV's inputs it is plugged into.
help.avr_pick_typed = Type the receiver's IP address yourself when it is not found on the network.
help.avr_pick_none = Check the receiver is on, on the same network as the TV, with Network Control set to Always On in its menu. Or type its IP address.

